    "title": "Lakes Region residents pack state pesticide meeting as neonicotinoid restrictions advance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago CONCORD — Residents from Wolfeboro, Laconia and surrounding Lakes Region communities turned out in force Monday, packing the room for a New Hampshire Pesticide Control Board meeting as the board took a significant step toward reducing the use of neonicotinoid pesticides on non-agricultural turf and classifying four of the chemicals as restricted-use pesticides. Read full article",
